          "code": "FIN_AP_LLM_NO_INSTALLMENT_FOUND",
          "id": "1771010391720",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771010391721_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a response-generation node. The system has already determined that no installment exists for the user’s request.\n\nContext Inputs\n\nUser Input: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nChat History: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.chatHistory}} \n\n\n**Task**\nReturn a clear, user-friendly message indicating that no installments were found. Must mention all the filters that get applied which are {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.suppliers}} {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.paymentTerms}} {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.legalEntities}}. Make sure to only show the names and not IDs (*Do not show the quotes to the user), currency is {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.Currency}}, business unit is {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.BU}}, and the date range is from {{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_LLM_PROCESS_VARIABLES.$output.startDate}} to {{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_LLM_PROCESS_VARIABLES.$output.endDate}} (convert the dates to 'yyyy-mm-dd' format). Explicitly says the literal names of the filters, not the shortcut/code name/abbreviations. If there is a filter that is empty, do not need to state the filter. Do not make up names for any filters.\nFor example:\n\"The applied filters are: \n- Supplier name: ABC\n- Business unit: XYZ\n- Payment terms: ...\n- Legal entity:...\n- Date range:...\n- Currency: ...\"\n- Make sure to state the filters in natural language, do not use back-end abbreviated language. Use 'space' when necessary.\n\n**Do not**\n\n* Re-evaluate filters\n* Reference prior logic or system decisions\n* Add explanations, suggestions, or follow-up questions\n\n**Output Requirements**\n\n* Return **only** the JSON structure below\n* Ensure valid JSON formatting\n* Preserve field names, order, and data types exactly\n\nFor example:\n[\n  {\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"content\": [\"No installments were found for the provided filters. The applied filters are:\"],\n    \"sequence\": 1\n  },\n{\n  \"type\": \"list\",\n  \"heading\": \"Applied filters\",\n  \"content\": [\"<item1>\", \"<item2>\"], \n  \"sequence\": 3\n}\n]"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_tokens": 32000,
                "p": 0.25
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_PROVIDER_CERT_BASIC_LLAMA_3_3_70B",
              "model": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_GPT_OSS_120B",
              "modelName": "GPT OSS 120B (Basic)",
              "provider": "CERT_BASIC"
            },
            "name": "Not Supported Filter"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "FIN_AP_LLM_NOT_SUPPORTED_FILTER",
          "id": "1769629693235",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769629693236_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a response-generation node. The system has already determined that there are unsupported filters for the user’s request.\n\nContext Inputs\n\nUser Input: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nChat History: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.chatHistory}} \n\n\n**Task**\nReturn a clear, user-friendly message indicating that user has requested unsupported  filter(s) for the installment drill-down.\n- You can only support 3 different filters: supplier name, legal entity, payment terms. If there are any filters outside of this group from chat history. Inform the user on the unsupported filters.\n\n\n**Do not**\n\n* Re-evaluate filters\n* Reference prior logic or system decisions\n* Add explanations, suggestions, or follow-up questions\n\n**Output Requirements**\n\n* Return **only** the JSON structure below\n* Ensure valid JSON formatting\n* Preserve field names, order, and data types exactly\n\n[\n  {\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"content\": [\"I can only support installment drill-down on these 3 filters: supplier name, legal entity, payment terms. Please provide data belonging to this group.\"],\n    \"sequence\": 1\n  }\n]"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_tokens": 32000,
                "p": 0.25
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_PROVIDER_CERT_BASIC_LLAMA_3_3_70B",
              "model": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_GPT_OSS_120B",
              "modelName": "GPT OSS 120B (Basic)",
